Dragon Burst renut 0117: the Swap pacing follows the frame rate the game asked for

sa2_renut_pacing released each Swap on a fixed 60 Hz grid (kRefresh = 1/60), so frame_rate = 120 and unlocked stayed at
60 FPS on the Renut (Odin 3, 2026-10-29: the screen at 120 Hz, game_fps 58.7). The refresh is now one of
rex::graphics::GetGuestVblankRate (60, 120, 144, or 1000 for unlocked; unknown = 60).

diff --git a/app/src/renut_engine/gpu/sa2_renut_pacing.cpp b/app/src/renut_engine/gpu/sa2_renut_pacing.cpp
--- a/app/src/renut_engine/gpu/sa2_renut_pacing.cpp
+++ b/app/src/renut_engine/gpu/sa2_renut_pacing.cpp
@@ -34,6 +34,7 @@
